{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/49XiAG3zd7MUBkiGft4AxQ?click_id=1152860574","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:59.130292+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/49XiAG3zd7MUBkiGft4AxQ?click_id=1152860574","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Q2Tiav2gVyazlSxfUJJwAHBia5umx17AjMOYKWp6cicyhKUXoeUVUPNLJ1woAmD8ypR1ib5GIX9R4doic9CX7pk1Ch24WEfg5CuywZhnkwApnSY0/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为充分利用全国研究生教育的优质资源，增进网络安全领域的学术交流，促进网络空间安全学科的青年人才成长进步，推动网络安全技术发展，国防科技大学举办2026年“网络空间安全前沿技术”全国研究生暑期学校，由电子对抗学院具体承办。本次暑期学校将聘请网络空间领域一流名师举办学术报告、开展专题授课，并组织丰富多样的学术交流、参观见学和网络安全技能实训等活动。诚挚邀请全国高校、科研院所网络空间安全相关学科专业的高年级本科生、研究生参加。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyawbGtibmZFHiaHTs6ib0ypSgia2MIuHMeQTTC5txXfs6FnWL3xppMqdzJpSOGpqcCKBpR3libHmluMMWlPeMFCaOJ0Q70ZH9NbibPdoE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>01、时间地点</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyaz31bNic9iaWOgBLgq9yA6ibvs5EB1fXU97T8CsBBAibG6oE42x20lr5rzxt3Q5TBMhPauyo2iaOaZ4b0uNgEdrKibceibWe3Cj0gLvuc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 报到时间：2026年7月26日</span></p><p><span>2. 活动时间：2026年7月27日-30日</span></p><p><span>3. 活动地点：安徽省合肥市国防科技大学电子对抗学院</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyawcWZEZDUicEsU7VGwccLTxyb8cn2h8h881CXL6lLaxolxg1UZROyyxCRs96Eib1OkDu5mQx9a6BC4jzYyEWINP1FABiazHMCS6Pc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>02、报名条件和安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyawmHqFO1mQF3Mjs70pZDRgfickzX2vEPVbBoic4RzGHR8166RIHG7w752yXic7eCibrhjqYquC5ibv45C2siaQd3tuj9utvArrxOIaSg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>招生对象</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>全国高校、科研院所网络空间安全、信息安全、计算机科学与技术、网络工程等相关学科专业本科生和硕士研究生；具备较好创新能力、团队组织能力和沟通能力，矢志科技强国事业，在网络空间安全领域具有扎实基础、具备较高科研潜力。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>招生人数</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>计划80人。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请材料清单</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>① 2026年网络空间安全前沿技术全国研究生暑期学校报名表（见附件）；</span></p><p><span>②学生证、研究生录取通知书或其它能够证明学员学历层次及身份的有效文件；</span></p><p><span>③ 学习成绩单；</span></p><p><span>④ 科研成果佐证材料。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyawIG6f5HFVmYibhdQGe8Y36VBYLHwdwiaTfHUPpoxhLcC5m6NxupfuS2YmyHPFGtQicf0fQL8iaklSClLicUxPmDnUe4VQ0SCwe6Rxk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>扫描“在线报名”二维码（https://v.wjx.cn/vm/rXHYb5M.aspx）线上报名，并将报名表等申请材料发送至chen.wang@nudt.edu.cn邮箱。</span></p><p><span>报名表需提交推荐单位盖章PDF扫描版，若确实无法盖章需同时提交教育部学信网学籍验证报告或学生证PDF扫描版。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>截止时间和遴选方式等</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>报名截止时间为2026年7月20日21时。</span></p><p><span>遴选方式：暑期学校组委会将综合学术水平等条件择优遴选，7月21日前通过微信或电子邮件等方式向学员本人发送录取通知。学员收到录取通知后需在24小时内回复是否参加，确认参加者原则上不得无故放弃。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyaz9bdklwXhHC9P3Vm0ZpEnvp8leR8hWOq7PkIzcYbkuia40y8IdyVsMGVNQicPBibWDjyEZNpt3x6zXCAvFam2AzL7IlVQRrE52bk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>03、费用安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyawehf32mzATgSzW8QN2icFeiasnahPHwvFCtkT4Mc1aDeYbJjgb0vEFLwqnHKudDbUDice1SUAVFll7OIrBVaYjRWibBP0OtqJFvLM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次暑期学校承担参加人员活动期间的住宿、餐饮、学习用品和参观费用，不包含往返交通费。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyayK0SeJjoKUIoUwicFNTBZEAddvF8tM1Tac2TPTktSGTqER5TPbHJbHk7da5YEUmqAmic8CiaL2OhtqrbB9M6yLia0bOWkP8v5UCOw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>04、联系人</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyaz9ibUNWwI9hehqdGbxaSzKHBKYFfvG4nWbEd5vUn5FaxzRdwojLJKkBW5oCpn3EZVdj94BxGUC41LZyx0ndksq9yacJafKNVoQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>王老师，电话：15209881655</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyaxqR1ngodHlWicrdtHHGautDmrzqtC5dLbC51R9JOGriayv8nwBQOiaAFF72ueuLRn31aK3bFTeSH9PzvxBMTU3VRypEhnlQdzNvA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>05、其他注意事项</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Q2Tiav2gVyazTlG6unmA36SKNOgxmlCicUGExReyQu9CYc5jNo7TMTyrbYylnzIQsKQ9oW55WbicF2TVH3VatdRKFI9uLF8ribXAtJl9hs8z7UQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><